STANDARD: IS 12305 - Laboratory sintered (fritted) filters, porosity grading, classification and designation
TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS & QUALITY PARAMETERS:
Marking & Certification Mandates:
- 5.1 Packing — Each sintered filter shall be suitably packed so as to avoid any shredding, disintegration and breakage during transit. A copy of Appendix D shall be packed with each filter to
- 5.2 Marking — Each package shall be marked permanently and legibly with the following:
- a) Name of the manufacturer or his recognized trade-mark;
- b) Designation of porosity grade ( see 3.1 );
- d) Lot No. for identification or manufacturing date;

